[
  {
    "text": "his midnight visits to the elm",
    "start_ind": 253,
    "end_ind": 283
  },
  {
    "text": "same route would be taken",
    "start_ind": 464,
    "end_ind": 489
  },
  {
    "text": "inter himself alive in the same spot",
    "start_ind": 514,
    "end_ind": 550
  },
  {
    "text": "his reappearance",
    "start_ind": 574,
    "end_ind": 590
  },
  {
    "text": "he who should adventure in",
    "start_ind": 660,
    "end_ind": 686
  },
  {
    "text": "come out\nagain",
    "start_ind": 701,
    "end_ind": 715
  },
  {
    "text": "enter it",
    "start_ind": 735,
    "end_ind": 743
  },
  {
    "text": "betake himself to subterranean retreats",
    "start_ind": 803,
    "end_ind": 842
  },
  {
    "text": "I trod upon the roof of caverns",
    "start_ind": 1210,
    "end_ind": 1241
  },
  {
    "text": "revisit the elm",
    "start_ind": 1598,
    "end_ind": 1613
  },
  {
    "text": "I took my former stand",
    "start_ind": 1832,
    "end_ind": 1854
  },
  {
    "text": "person again appeared",
    "start_ind": 1860,
    "end_ind": 1881
  },
  {
    "text": "his\ndeparture",
    "start_ind": 2138,
    "end_ind": 2151
  },
  {
    "text": "The track into which he now led me",
    "start_ind": 2212,
    "end_ind": 2246
  },
  {
    "text": "my conductor struck into a path",
    "start_ind": 3166,
    "end_ind": 3197
  },
  {
    "text": "we had lately trodden",
    "start_ind": 3248,
    "end_ind": 3269
  },
  {
    "text": "This track led us to the skirt of the wilderness",
    "start_ind": 3292,
    "end_ind": 3340
  },
  {
    "text": "we\nreached an open field",
    "start_ind": 3362,
    "end_ind": 3386
  },
  {
    "text": "directed his\nsteps towards the barn",
    "start_ind": 3564,
    "end_ind": 3599
  },
  {
    "text": "he entered",
    "start_ind": 3612,
    "end_ind": 3622
  },
  {
    "text": "I retired to the shelter of a\nneighbouring shed",
    "start_ind": 3899,
    "end_ind": 3946
  },
  {
    "text": "invite him to my uncle's",
    "start_ind": 4458,
    "end_ind": 4482
  },
  {
    "text": "I paid a visit to Inglefield",
    "start_ind": 5469,
    "end_ind": 5497
  },
  {
    "text": "his motives for coming to America",
    "start_ind": 6893,
    "end_ind": 6926
  },
  {
    "text": "disappeared from his side",
    "start_ind": 9497,
    "end_ind": 9522
  },
  {
    "text": "some one on horseback stopped at this gate",
    "start_ind": 10328,
    "end_ind": 10370
  },
  {
    "text": "some one would come from the house",
    "start_ind": 10450,
    "end_ind": 10484
  },
  {
    "text": "desired him to go",
    "start_ind": 10681,
    "end_ind": 10698
  },
  {
    "text": "He laid aside his work and went",
    "start_ind": 10733,
    "end_ind": 10764
  },
  {
    "text": "Clithero at length entered",
    "start_ind": 11029,
    "end_ind": 11055
  },
  {
    "text": "the traveller proceeded",
    "start_ind": 11061,
    "end_ind": 11084
  },
  {
    "text": "he who had led me through so devious a tract",
    "start_ind": 11844,
    "end_ind": 11888
  },
  {
    "text": "him who stopped at the gate",
    "start_ind": 11981,
    "end_ind": 12008
  },
  {
    "text": "he came",
    "start_ind": 12864,
    "end_ind": 12871
  },
  {
    "text": "he prepared to return home",
    "start_ind": 12901,
    "end_ind": 12927
  },
  {
    "text": "him, to return.",
    "start_ind": 13041,
    "end_ind": 13056
  },
  {
    "text": "he would not remain",
    "start_ind": 13427,
    "end_ind": 13446
  },
  {
    "text": "I went along with him",
    "start_ind": 13530,
    "end_ind": 13551
  },
  {
    "text": "we set off together",
    "start_ind": 13639,
    "end_ind": 13658
  },
  {
    "text": "the elm at\nlength appeared in sight",
    "start_ind": 15111,
    "end_ind": 15146
  },
  {
    "text": "I stopped short,",
    "start_ind": 15208,
    "end_ind": 15224
  },
  {
    "text": "Let us turn down this path",
    "start_ind": 15824,
    "end_ind": 15850
  },
  {
    "text": "I had followed him",
    "start_ind": 15902,
    "end_ind": 15920
  },
  {
    "text": "Go with me down this\npath",
    "start_ind": 16130,
    "end_ind": 16155
  },
  {
    "text": "pass\nthrough them",
    "start_ind": 16268,
    "end_ind": 16285
  },
  {
    "text": "he followed me",
    "start_ind": 16287,
    "end_ind": 16301
  },
  {
    "text": "we entered the\nwood",
    "start_ind": 16330,
    "end_ind": 16349
  },
  {
    "text": "I had now gone too far",
    "start_ind": 16395,
    "end_ind": 16417
  },
  {
    "text": "to recede",
    "start_ind": 16418,
    "end_ind": 16427
  },
  {
    "text": "I have led you to it",
    "start_ind": 16555,
    "end_ind": 16575
  },
  {
    "text": "I have brought you\nhither",
    "start_ind": 16702,
    "end_ind": 16727
  },
  {
    "text": "disposition to\nreturn",
    "start_ind": 20847,
    "end_ind": 20868
  },
  {
    "text": "we reached\nInglefield's piazza",
    "start_ind": 20986,
    "end_ind": 21016
  },
  {
    "text": "He hurried from me into the house",
    "start_ind": 21254,
    "end_ind": 21287
  },
  {
    "text": "I turned my\nsteps home wards",
    "start_ind": 21308,
    "end_ind": 21336
  },
  {
    "text": "as I proceeded",
    "start_ind": 21355,
    "end_ind": 21369
  },
  {
    "text": "I hied, in fancy, to the wilderness",
    "start_ind": 21530,
    "end_ind": 21565
  },
  {
    "text": "I traced his footsteps",
    "start_ind": 21623,
    "end_ind": 21645
  },
  {
    "text": "I resolved to go to Inglefield's",
    "start_ind": 22979,
    "end_ind": 23011
  },
  {
    "text": "On my way thither",
    "start_ind": 23114,
    "end_ind": 23131
  },
  {
    "text": "he was coming to my uncle's",
    "start_ind": 23523,
    "end_ind": 23550
  },
  {
    "text": "we would go into the wood together,",
    "start_ind": 23621,
    "end_ind": 23656
  },
  {
    "text": "We returned from the road into the first path",
    "start_ind": 23821,
    "end_ind": 23866
  },
  {
    "text": "proceeded",
    "start_ind": 23872,
    "end_ind": 23881
  },
  {
    "text": "we were in\nthe heart of Norwalk",
    "start_ind": 23956,
    "end_ind": 23987
  },
  {
    "text": "We lighted on a recess",
    "start_ind": 23989,
    "end_ind": 24011
  },
  {
    "text": "Here we stopped",
    "start_ind": 24132,
    "end_ind": 24147
  }
]